vice.ts`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/services/visionService.ts)** | Multi-model Gemini fallback engine (`gemini-2.0-flash`, `gemini-1.5-flash`, `gemini-1.5-pro`) with strict JSON schema parsing. |\\n| **[`aiSmsService.ts`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/services/aiSmsService.ts)** | Personalized FRS sit-down copy generator addressing handwritten card notes, planning periods, room numbers, \n<truncated 2021 bytes>","Description":"\"Update walkthrough.md with full line-by-line audit details and pure PWA features\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\brorm\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\9c9b5ef4-82a1-483f-9e9e-cb421c9396b3\\\\walkthrough.md\"","toolAction":"\"Writing walkthrough.md\"","toolSummary":"\"Update walkthrough.md\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
